V8 Thumb-2 port for Windows RT 8.x - V8's ARM32 JIT and builtins generate Thumb-2 (T32) code instead of A32.
For V8 15.0.245.28 (Chromium 150.0.7871.226, v8 revision 17700469f857c3aaf7e2803a9b77b7b25ced9399).
From the V8 root:      git -c core.autocrlf=false apply v8-thumb2.patch
From a Chromium src:   git -c core.autocrlf=false apply --directory=v8 v8-thumb2.patch
This file is the result of the rules in port/rules applied by port/tools/t2run.py (decisions in port/DESIGN.md), byte
for byte the V8 tree of the Venetium v1.3.1 Thumb-2 build. 41 files (one new: src/codegen/arm/t32-encodings-arm.h).

